#: assets/headers-sec.php:51
msgid ""
"Allows sites to opt in to reporting and/or enforcement of Certificate "
"Transparency requirements, which prevents the use of misissued certificates "
"for that site from going unnoticed. When a site enables the Expect-CT header,"
" they are requesting that Chrome check that any certificate for that site "
"appears in public CT logs."
msgstr ""
"Allows sites to opt in to reporting and/or enforcement of Certificate "
"Transparency requirements, which prevents the use of misissued certificates "
"for that site from going unnoticed. When a site enables the Expect-CT header,"
" they are requesting that Chrome check that any certificate for that site "
"appears in public CT logs."

